WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.291
It was our first evening in San Francisco.

2
00:00:07.292 --> 00:00:09.801
Sunny: This is Chinatown.

3
00:00:09.802 --> 00:00:13.031
Hana: Look at the stores and the

4
00:00:13.032 --> 00:00:15.926
buildings. I can hear them speak Chinese.

5
00:00:15.927 --> 00:00:23.744
Bada: Oh no. I can’t speak Chinese.

6
00:00:23.745 --> 00:00:25.032
Tom: Don’t worry, Bada.

7
00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:27.246
They speak English too. Bada:

8
00:00:27.247 --> 00:00:28.765
Whew! Tom:

9
00:00:28.766 --> 00:00:33.384
Let’s go in. Waiter:

10
00:00:33.385 --> 00:00:35.579
Good evening, ladies and gentleman. Sunny:

11
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:39.268
A table for five, please.

12
00:00:39.269 --> 00:00:41.539
Waiter: Right this way, please.

13
00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.565
Hana: Ni-hao-ma.

14
00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:47.560
Waiter: Ho.

15
00:00:47.561 --> 00:00:50.837
Tom: I didn’t know you spoke Chinese!

16
00:00:50.838 --> 00:00:58.031
Hana: Just the greeting. That’s all.

17
00:00:58.032 --> 00:00:59.584
Waiter: Here is the menu.

18
00:00:59.585 --> 00:01:01.884
Let me know when you are ready.

19
00:01:01.885 --> 00:01:06.245
Mom: Thank you.

20
00:01:06.246 --> 00:01:08.734
I love Chinese food.

21
00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:15.563
One day, I would like to visit China!

